# Plaintext local-stack overrides for `bun run dev:local` — never committed.
.env.local
# Only the CLI's scratch state. A blanket `supabase` rule silently swallowed
# every *new* migration — the eleven already committed stayed tracked, so it
# looked fine, while 20260719214023_remote_schema.sql and
# 20260721050000_licence_full_text_and_anon_writes.sql never made it in. The
# second of those defines policies that are live on the project, which is how
# the schema history drifted from the database.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
# Run 'supabase gen types` to generate the types automatically after login to supabase.
**/types/database.ts
